meta {
  name: Toggle Two-Factor Authentication
  type: http
  seq: 4
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/settings/2fa/toggle
  body: json
  auth: bearer
}

headers {
  Content-Type: application/json
  Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{authToken}}
}

body:json {
  {
    "enabled": true
  }
}

docs {
  # Toggle Two-Factor Authentication
  Enable or disable Two-Factor Authentication (2FA) for this account.

  ### Authentication
  Bearer Token

  ### Allowed Roles
  - Founder
- Mentor
- Admin

  ### Request Body Fields
  - `enabled` (boolean, required) - True to activate 2FA, false to deactivate.

  ### Response Status Codes
  - `200` - 2FA preference updated.
  - `401` - Unauthorized.

  ### Response Example (200)
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "twoFactorEnabled": true,
    "message": "Two-factor authentication enabled."
  }
  ```
}
